# Converted from the old Grade 2 Survex data (Grade2/Grade2/PBCrawl.svx).

# > Ogof Draenen: PB Crawl, a small side passage near Spare Rib
# 
# This data represents a fairly rough compass & tape survey with
# occasional estimated clino readings.
# 
# Survey conducted on Sunday 6th November by Morgannwg Caving Club & Guests.
# Surveyed by: Kevin Munn; Liam Kealy; Ali Garman; Dave Glover
# Data entry: Tim Long

survey pbcrawl

# Station Equivalences

# Specify units of measurement

# Magnetic North to Grid North correction
# Mag deviation at the time of the readings (9-Oct-94) was
# 4.2 degrees (data from OS sheet 161, 1991).

# Data ordering

# The survey data

# From   To      Brg     Dist    Clino
centreline
  # BCRA2
  sd length 0.5 metres
  sd compass clino 2.5 degrees
  calibrate compass 4.2
  data normal from to length compass clino
  1	2	22.2	183	0	# 1 = Cairn @ Pitch Bypass
  2	3	22	150	0
  3	4	10.1	138	0
  4	5	12.4	136	0
  5	6	11.5	138	0
  6	7	12.5	138	0
  7	8	6.6	138	0
  8	9	8	128	0
  8	8.1	12.4	2	0
  7	7.1	10	232	0
  7.1	7.2	10	128	0

endcentreline
endsurvey
